# Ignore everything
*

# Unignore directories so git can traverse into them
!*/

# ===== ROOT FILES =====
!index.html
!services.html
!styles.css
!script.js
!README.md
!.gitignore

# ===== PUBLIC ASSETS =====
# Images are tracked; videos are not (too large — host externally)
!public/*.jpg
!public/*.png
!public/*.svg
!public/*.gif
!public/*.webp
